.SH NAME
example_points \- Documentation for the point example program 
The points example refines a domain according to a given set of points\&.
.PP
The points can be generated by calling the helper program \fBpoints/generate_points2\&.c\fP (2D) or \fBpoints/generate_points3\&.c\fP (3D)\&. The point example itself resides in the source files for \fC2D\fP and \fC3D\fP\&. 
